cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "AquaSight: Physics-Informed Machine Learning for Water Quality Prediction Across South African River Catchments"
authors:
  - family-names: Savadogo
    given-names: Modeste
  - family-names: Diallo
    given-names: Mamadou Tahirou
date-released: 2026
url: "https://github.com/modestesavadogo/ey-ai-data-challenge-2026-aquasight"
license: MIT
abstract: >
  Machine learning pipeline predicting Total Alkalinity, Electrical Conductance,
  and Dissolved Reactive Phosphorus at South African river monitoring stations
  from open satellite and environmental data alone, achieving R² = 0.4829 and
  2nd Runner-Up (Top 3 of 24,000+ teams, 146 countries) in the EY Open Science
  AI & Data Challenge 2026.
keywords:
  - water quality
  - remote sensing
  - machine learning
  - spatial generalization
  - EY Open Science AI Data Challenge
  - South Africa
